     A*  WMXHP - Client Control Heading File                          *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  Description:                                                 *
     A*    As the client requires each of the generic fields in the   *
     A*    Client Control File to be defined for their purpose, the   *
     A*    description associated with each field can be uniquely     *
